// GHIDRA_COMMENT Algorithm:
// GHIDRA_COMMENT 1. Creates tagged UI entries for common command buttons (next/done/back/disband/sleep and arrow groups).
// GHIDRA_COMMENT 2. Registers picture resources for command states using per-tag bitmap IDs (includes 1199/1203/1209/1211 family).
// GHIDRA_COMMENT 3. Builds grouped arrow/button clusters for directional/order variants and map-operation controls.
